{"speciesId":443,"names":{"fr":"Griknot","es":"Gible","en":"Gible","ja":"フカマル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It nests in small, horizontal holes in cave walls. It pounces to catch prey that stray too close."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It once lived in the tropics. To avoid the cold, it lives in caves warmed by geothermal heat."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It nests in horizontal holes warmed by geothermal heat. Foes who get too close can expect to be pounced on and bitten."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It nests in horizontal holes warmed by geothermal heat. Foes who get too close can expect to be pounced on and bitten."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Malgré sa maladresse, son énorme gueule lui permet de lancer des attaques puissantes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Malgré sa maladresse, son énorme gueule lui permet de lancer des attaques puissantes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It attacks using its huge mouth. While its attacks are powerful, it hurts itself out of clumsiness, too."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il niche dans des cavités chauffées par géothermie, dont il bondit pour déchiqueter tout intrus."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en agujeros en las cuevas, al amparo del calor geotérmico. Si se acerca un enemigo, le muerde."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It nests in horizontal holes warmed by geothermal heat. Foes who get too close can expect to be pounced on and bitten."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"地熱で 温められた 横穴で 暮らす。 敵が 近づくと 穴から 飛び出して 大口で かみつく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il niche dans les petits trous horizontaux des murs des grottes. Il bondit pour saisir sa proie."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Anida en pequeños agujeros en las paredes de cuevas. Cuando una presa pasa cerca, salta hacia ella."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It nests in small, horizontal holes in cave walls. It pounces to catch prey that stray too close."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"洞窟の 小さな 横穴を ねぐらにする。獲物が 近づくと 素早く 飛び出して 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il niche dans des cavités chauffées par géothermie, dont il bondit pour déchiqueter tout intrus."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Vive en agujeros en las cuevas, al amparo del calor geotérmico. Si se acerca un enemigo, le muerde."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It nests in horizontal holes warmed by geothermal heat. Foes who get too close can expect to be pounced on and bitten."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"地熱で 温められた 横穴で 暮らす。 敵が 近づくと 穴から 飛び出して 大口で かみつく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il niche dans les petits trous horizontaux des murs des grottes. Il bondit pour saisir sa proie."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Anida en pequeños agujeros en las paredes de cuevas. Cuando una presa pasa cerca, salta hacia ella."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It nests in small, horizontal holes in cave walls. It pounces to catch prey that stray too close."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"洞窟の 小さな 横穴を ねぐらにする。獲物が 近づくと 素早く 飛び出して 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"On le trouve dans les cavernes bien chauffées par géothermie. S’il a froid malgré tout, il dort en tas avec ses congénères pour se réchauffer."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Vive en el interior de cuevas, al amparo del calor geotérmico. Si aun así sigue sintiendo frío, se junta con sus congéneres haciendo una piña."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It lives in caves warmed by geothermal heat. Even so, when the weather gets cold, it will huddle close with others of its kind."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"地熱で 温かい 洞窟に 暮らしている。 それでも 寒くなると 仲間と 身を 寄せ合って かたまる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il attend le passage d’une proie pour bondir hors de son trou et la croquer. Dans son élan, il se casse parfois les dents."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Permanece oculto en cuevas y cuando pasa una presa, se abalanza sobre ella y la muerde con tanta fuerza que hasta se le rompen los dientes."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It skulks in caves, and when prey or an enemy passes by, it leaps out and chomps them. The force of its attack sometimes chips its teeth."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"穴倉に 潜み 獲物や 敵が 横切ると 飛びだして 噛みつく。 勢い余り 歯が 欠けることも。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il saute sur tout ce qui bouge pour y planter ses dents. Cette manie lui vaut quelques blessures, mais il n’en a que faire."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"En cuanto percibe un objeto en movimiento, se lanza contra él y le asesta dentelladas. A veces se hiere a sí mismo, pero no le importa."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It reacts to anything that moves—flies right at it and bites it. Sometimes it injures itself, but it doesn’t care too much."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"動くものに 反応し 飛びついて 噛みつく。 自分が 傷つくことも あるけれど あまり 気にしていない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il vient d’un endroit où il fait bien plus chaud que dans la région d’Alola. La facture de chauffage est donc élevée quand on vit avec lui."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Un Pokémon habituado a un clima aún más cálido que el de Alola. Quien convive con un Gible gasta mucho dinero en calefacción."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its original home is an area much hotter than Alola. If you’re planning to live with one, your heating bill will soar."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"アローラより さらに 暑い 土地が 本来の 棲み処。 一緒に 住むなら 暖房代が かかる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il aime les cavités étroites dans les grottes chauffées par géothermie. Elles le tiennent au chaud lorsque le blizzard souffle à l’extérieur."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Vive en pequeños agujeros de cuevas calentadas por la energía geotérmica, por lo que no pasa frío ni aunque fuera se desate una ventisca."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Gible prefers to stay in narrow holes in the sides of caves heated by geothermal energy. This way, Gible can stay warm even during a blizzard."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"地熱で 暖められた 洞窟の 狭い 横穴を 好む。 外が 吹雪いていても 凍えずにすむのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il attaque et entraîne dans son antre tout ce qui bouge, sans distinction. Sa gueule est immense, mais son estomac est relativement petit."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Ataca indiscriminadamente a cualquier cosa que se mueva y la arrastra a su agujero. Pese a tener una boca enorme, su estómago es pequeño."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Gible attacks anything that moves, and it drags whatever it catches into the crevice that is its lair. Despite the big mouth, Gible’s stomach is small."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"動くものを 見境なしに 襲い ねぐらの 横穴に 引きずりこむ。 大口だが 胃袋は 小さめ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"It nests in caves untouched by sunlight. Its sharp teeth may fall out when worn away or after an impact, but they regrow within a few days."}],"varieties":[{"id":443,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name